  "description": "Saltwater Verse is a vintage handwritten script font inspired by faded postcards, handwritten travel journals, sun-bleached beach photographs, and the timeless charm of Mediterranean summers. With its rough texture, imperfect strokes, and naturally weathered appearance, this typeface captures the feeling of memories preserved in old letters, forgotten travel diaries, and cherished seaside adventures.\nDesigned to bring warmth, authenticity, and character to your projects, Saltwater Verse features beautiful alternate characters that allow you to create more natural and expressive typography. The handcrafted details give every word a personal touch, making your designs feel genuine, nostalgic, and full of story.\nWhether you’re creating branding, packaging, logos, wedding invitations, travel posters, social media graphics, book covers, apparel, postcards, journals, café menus, beach-themed products, or vintage-inspired marketing materials, Saltwater Verse delivers a timeless handwritten aesthetic that instantly stands out.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Saltwater Verse is a vintage handwritten script font inspired by faded postcards, handwritten travel journals, sun-bleached beach photographs, and the timeless charm of Mediterranean summers. With its rough texture, imperfect strokes, and naturally weathered appearance, this typeface captures the feeling of memories preserved in old letters, forgotten travel diaries, and cherished seaside adventures.</p>\n<p>Designed to bring warmth, authenticity, and character to your projects, Saltwater Verse features beautiful alternate characters that allow you to create more natural and expressive typography. The handcrafted details give every word a personal touch, making your designs feel genuine, nostalgic, and full of story.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re creating branding, packaging, logos, wedding invitations, travel posters, social media graphics, book covers, apparel, postcards, journals, café menus, beach-themed products, or vintage-inspired marketing materials, Saltwater Verse delivers a timeless handwritten aesthetic that instantly stands out.</p>",
